      "body": "## Motivation\n\nTwo rows in the server arguments docs list choices that no longer match the parser.\n\nThe `--quantization` row lists `marlin` as a choice, but the parser rejects it:\n\n```\nerror: argument --quantization: invalid choice: 'marlin'\n```\n\n`--quantization` takes its choices from `QUANTIZATION_CHOICES` in `python/sglang/srt/arg_groups/choices.py`, which has no `marlin` entry. The row was also missing three choices the parser accepts: `auto-round-int8`, `mxfp_w4a8` and `humming`.\n\nThe `--kv-cache-dtype` row in the same table is missing `mxfp8`, which the parser accepts (`python/sglang/srt/arg_groups/fields/model.py`), and its description is missing the help text's sentence about it.\n\n## Modifications\n\n- `--quantization`: the choices now match `QUANTIZATION_CHOICES` exactly, in the same order. `marlin` is removed; `auto-round-int8`, `mxfp_w4a8` and `humming` are added.\n- `--kv-cache-dtype`: `mxfp8` is added to the choices, and the description now matches the flag's help text (`\"mxfp8\" is supported by the FA4 backend.` and \"MX-style block-size-16\").\n\nChecked by extracting the `<code>` values and the description from each row and comparing them to the lists and help string in the source (`--quantization`: 31 entries, identical; `--kv-cache-dtype`: 8 entries and the help text, identical). `test/registered/unit/server_args/test_server_args_docs_coverage.py` passes; it checks flag names, not choice lists.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Update documentation according to [Write documentations](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#write-documentations).\n\nPrepared with AI assistance (Claude Code) and reviewed with GitHub Copilot.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:white_check_mark: [Run #38818813557](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38818813557)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #38818813515](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38818813515)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:heavy_minus_sign: **No AMD PR run found for this commit**.<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
